# x = the first string, y = all numeric columns (KQL alignment); bar charts have no default series.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../data/orders.csv'
| summarize revenue = sum(amount), orders = count() by customerId
| top 3 by revenue desc
| render barchart
---- expected
customerId | revenue | orders
string     | real    | long
-----------+---------+-------
c-042      | 1250.5  |      7
c-007      |  980.0  |      6
c-113      |  402.25 |      4
render: barchart x=customerId y=[revenue, orders]
